        "video_prompt": "Begin on Dedue already knocked into a low defensive crouch, one knee near the ground, shield scraping dust as he absorbs an offscreen nonlethal practice strike from screen right. Mercedes closes in behind-left, drops to a kneel, and extends both open hands toward Dedue's shoulder and shield arm. A short warm white-gold healing pulse travels from her hands around his shoulder, sleeve, forearm, and shield rim; the pulse visibly helps him push up from the knee. End with Dedue recovered into a low shield-wall stance, shield still pointed screen right toward the threat; Mercedes remains behind-left, lower and visibly exhausted, hands dropping after the spent heal.",
        "dialogue_audio": "Dimitri, offscreen: \"杜笃--\" Dedue, under strain: \"殿下，看前面。\" Mercedes, close and urgent: \"肩膀还能动吗？我来撑住。\" Shield scrape, dust hit, one short white-magic swell, then Dedue plants the shield with a dull thud.",
